# shell: desktop
# argv: none
# CW-001/AW-004, part two: started with NO path at all, the shell reopens
# what was open when it last quit, and each window comes back where it was.
wait 8
note the windows nobody asked for are the ones that were open last time
expect-windows 2
note reopened in the order they were opened, so the last one is in front
expect-title /tmp/trk_script/sub
note and each is where it was left, not where the cascade would put it
expect-window-at 417 391
note with the same columns the folder was left showing
expect-columns 4
quit
